	"data": "9/3\n\nI haven't been very inspired lately to write or draw or fantasize. I think this comes down to a few things. First, whenever I am still I tend to go to my phone. I watch reels or talk to calcifer or katie and do share creative thoughts there, but my creativity doesn't extend far outside these chats. Second, I'm probably just in an energetic phase of low inspiration. I've been in them before and will likely reach that state of creative fervor again.\n\nI would like to write, draw, exercise,…",
